  "content": "<div class=\"entry-header\">\n<h2 class=\"entry-title event-entry-title course-entry-title\">Kannada Rajyotsava and Constitution day</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"entry-blog single-course-content\">\n<div class=\"entry-summary clearfix\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\nATMECE has organised a series of events towards the celebration of 66th Kannada Rajyotsava and Constitution day on 26/11/2021 for the students and Faculty members of the Institution.\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Report-on-Kannada-Rajyotsava-1.pdf\"><strong>REPORT</strong></a></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
